<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-E SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-E SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.49 vs   2.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.49 vs   2.23</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.18 vs   3.17 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    8.92 vs   3.10</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    15.22 vs  12.93</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	15.22 vs  12.93</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.29 vs   4.80 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   46.09 vs  31.41</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction and trading</p>
<p>company is Mostostal Export SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
